<title>UK: Grampian TV H1 pretax profit up after gain.</title>
<headline>Grampian TV H1 pretax profit up after gain.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.0		   vs 5.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.0		    vs 1.25</p>
<p> Pretax		     8.1		    vs 2.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   11.9		   vs 12.7</p>
<p> Operating profit	 3.1		    vs 2.7</p>
<p> Exceptional profit     4.7		    vs nil</p>
<p> Net taxed		  5.9		    vs 1.9</p>
<p> Pay date		   December 16</p>
<p>Div registration date  November 11  Ex-div date		November 4</p>
<p>NOTE - Current first-half adjusted earnings per share was 6.8p, excluding the 11.2p profit on the sale of Central Scotland Radio Ltd.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
